/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:99:\paragraph{SOS/Lasserre hierarchy for \giso.}  Let $G = (V(G), E(G))$ and $H = (V(H), E(H))$ be two graphs such that $|V(G)| = |V(E)|$, $|E(G)| = |E(H)|$. The degree-$r$ SOS/Lasserre hierarchy for the natural integer programming the isomorphism problem between $G$ and $H$ is to find a normalized linear pseudo-expectation operator $\pE[\cdot]$ on the space of real polynomials of degree at most~$r$ over the indeterminates $(\Pi[u \mapsto v])_{u \in V(G), v \in V(H)}$ such that:
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-100-    \begin{enumerate}[a.]
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:101:        \item $\pE[(\Pi[u \mapsto v]^2 - \Pi[u \mapsto v]) \cdot q] = 0$ for all $u \in V(G)$, $v \in V(H)$, and polynomials~$q$;
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:102:        \item $\pE[(\sum_{v \in V(H)} \Pi[u \mapsto v] - 1) \cdot q] = 0$ for all $u \in V(G)$ and polynomials~$q$; and similarly, $\pE[(\sum_{u \in V(G)} \Pi[u \mapsto v] - 1) \cdot q] = 0$ for all $v \in V(H)$ and polynomials~$q$;
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:103:        \item \label{item:SOS-GISO} $\pE[(\sum_{\{u,u'\} \in E(G)} \sum_{v, v' : \{v,v'\} \in E(H)} \Pi[u \mapsto v] \Pi[u' \mapsto v'] -  |E(G)|) \cdot p^2] \geq 0$ for all polynomials $p$;
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:104:        \item $\pE[p^2] \geq 0$ for all polynomials~$p$.
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-105-    \end{enumerate}
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:106:We say there is degree-$r$ SOS refutation for the isomorphism between $G$ and $H$ if the pseudo-expectation operator with properties listed above does not exist.
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-107-
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-108-\begin{remark}
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex:109:It is equivalent to replace (\ref{item:SOS-GISO}) by ``$\pE[(\sum_{v, v' : \{v,v'\} \in E(H)} \Pi[u \mapsto v] \Pi[u' \mapsto v'] - 1) \cdot q] = 0$ for all $(u, u') \in E(G)$ and all polynomials $q$''.
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-110-\end{remark}
/tmp/paper_1401_src/preliminaries.tex-111-
