/tmp/paper_1401_src/abelian.tex-8-In this section, we show how our main results can be derived from a much broader class of assumptions than just Feige's \RXOR hypothesis.  In doing so, we are inspired by the recent $\NP$-hardness results of~\cite{Cha13}, along with the Lasserre gaps of~\cite{Tul09}.  The focus of these papers was on a specific type of predicates, which we now define.
